{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1000_018ele", "source_sha256": "5da25a5f2e492b8f1d0cc91cd8cbc835070e0d59d2a085b5d0a1efba07c3136e", "ja": "{$P$}！　\nこの前のライブ、楽しかったネ♪", "zh": "{$P$}！\n之前的演唱会很开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "f5c3df5cbc9764d56d6b2e23e2ef36495df53dec85790422886e05147a077abd", "ja": "海のお仕事、今度はいつあるのカナ？\nワタシ、すっごく楽しみだヨ～。", "zh": "下次什么时候会有在海边的工作啊？\n我好期待唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1002_p", "source_sha256": "00ad7a467ca87f14a11253934bc8337f2fccc272d0fb961dd7aa5d3e8bf92c77", "ja": "そうだな、夏の間は多いと思うけど……\nちょっとスケジュールを確認してみようか。", "zh": "我想想，在夏天期间应该会挺多的……\n我确认一下行程好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "55a7123ede7985da4af22e557536da1ae08920abfd5d5205a153bed756fa6ae9", "ja": "ウズウズ……ウズウズ……。", "zh": "（迫不及待）……（迫不及待）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "37ea5d3c549aa554255c49484fcd528f1b5dadfbf452729e19312af35844d7eb", "ja": "う～んっ、やっぱり待ちきれないヨ～！\n{$P$}、今すぐ海まで行っちゃおっ！", "zh": "嗯～我果然还是等不及啦～！\n{$P$}，现在马上出发去海边吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1005_p", "source_sha256": "47ba4ae3d83cf5414ad2d89147c3098fdcb5fd3e56a44a324233a1cec5bc98b3", "ja": "まてまてエレナ、落ち着こう。\nそんなに海の仕事が楽しかったのか？", "zh": "等等埃琳娜，冷静点啊。\n之前在海边的工作有那么开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "c9f6d70f9d1b6ff84cc111caf2fdcacc0764ee6ac47e6f7fc065d896b92bc279", "ja": "うんっ、とっても楽しかったヨー♪\nそれにね……。", "zh": "嗯，真的很开心喔～♪\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "27907253588affd2f08314dfa2c416c149f0dbe5e56cca817bb85e263d050fbe", "ja": "{$P$}が、いつもよりたくさん、\nワタシのことを見ててくれたから……エヘッ。", "zh": "{$P$}也比平常更用心地关注着我，\n所以……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b4d96f8cc01cce915c8dc8500b281f234f1caee930c9c50c00429247329d2436", "ja": "え……そんなに見てたか？　ご、ごめん。", "zh": "咦……我有那样紧盯着你吗？抱、抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "348b8124b6b632c7daaf1f00b6ca67bf6ece421f432a472225eed1ef9087bd7e", "ja": "ううん、イヤじゃないノ！　{$P$}が\n見てくれたほうが、ワタシ、元気が出るんだヨ♪", "zh": "不会，我不讨厌喔！有{$P$}\n关注着我，我才会更有活力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "abb4fb855a23a0962edf46a73660a5835cb2211c9c752de2fa4e266f11239f52", "ja": "{$P$}、いつもあんな風に、\nワタシのコト見てくれたらいいのにナ……♪", "zh": "要是{$P$}可以一直像那样\n看着我就好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1011_p", "source_sha256": "046a2c1c0e9efcf81c506a7dce216480686d3904089cf486e75fcde52be47301", "ja": "そうか……じゃあ次の仕事でも、\nエレナのことをしっかり見てるよ。", "zh": "这样啊……那么下次工作时，\n我也会好好看着埃琳娜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0033_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "3e9275d8bf433238d812ad32954856a8d717c9f5c6416a5d3e3acd0378273f42", "ja": "やったー！　{$P$}、大好き！\n楽しいお仕事、待ってるネ♪", "zh": "好耶～！我最喜欢{$P$}了！\n等你帮我接有趣的工作回来喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
